{"reference":"Jeremiah 38","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":38,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Within the Book of Jeremiah","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Jeremiah 38 is part of a book that brings together poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, repeated accounts, restoration material, oracles concerning nations, and an appendix. In the surrounding narrative, Jeremiah’s imprisonment, the city’s famine, and the threatened capture of Jerusalem belong to the book’s wider portrayal of catastrophe and survival through images of siege, confinement, displacement, and bodily vulnerability. This broader literary description is debated, so it should be treated as a way of reading the book’s received shape rather than as a settled account of how every part was composed.","verse_refs":["Jeremiah 10:1-25","Jeremiah 11:1-23","Jeremiah 12:1-17","Jeremiah 13:1-27","Jeremiah 14:1-22","Jeremiah 15:1-21","Jeremiah 16:1-21","Jeremiah 17:1-27","Jeremiah 18:1-23","Jeremiah 19:1-15","Jeremiah 1:1-19","Jeremiah 20:1-18","Jeremiah 21:1-14","Jeremiah 22:1-30","Jeremiah 23:1-40","Jeremiah 24:1-10","Jeremiah 25:1-38","Jeremiah 26:1-24","Jeremiah 27:1-22","Jeremiah 28:1-17","Jeremiah 29:1-32","Jeremiah 2:1-37","Jeremiah 30:1-24","Jeremiah 31:1-40","Jeremiah 32:1-44","Jeremiah 33:1-26","Jeremiah 34:1-22","Jeremiah 35:1-19","Jeremiah 36:1-32","Jeremiah 37:1-21","Jeremiah 39:1-18","Jeremiah 3:1-25","Jeremiah 40:1-16","Jeremiah 41:1-18","Jeremiah 42:1-22","Jeremiah 43:1-13","Jeremiah 44:1-30","Jeremiah 45:1-5","Jeremiah 46:1-28","Jeremiah 47:1-7","Jeremiah 48:1-47","Jeremiah 49:1-39","Jeremiah 4:1-31","Jeremiah 50:1-46","Jeremiah 51:1-64","Jeremiah 52:1-34","Jeremiah 5:1-31","Jeremiah 6:1-30","Jeremiah 7:1-34","Jeremiah 8:1-22","Jeremiah 9:1-26"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_038_ccc426a50744e8e59d86dfc2"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}